# default-midnight-violet (plan section 6): the page at rest at 1440 x 900, density 2, on a dark system in
# midnight-violet, the mode dark as the settings menu would set it. React's first paint settles within
# 1.5 s, so the shot waits 2 s.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme midnight-violet
wait 2000
shot default
